<title>JAPAN: Warabeya -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Warabeya -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to August 31, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 31.46		vs	   28.33</p>
<p> Operating	  409    million	  vs	  549    million</p>
<p> Current	    431    million	  vs	  501    million</p>
<p> Net		  139    million	  vs	  260    million</p>
<p> EPS		   14.74 yen	  vs	   29.16 yen</p>
<p> Shares		9 million	  vs	   9 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Warabeya Nichiyo Co Ltd is a maker and seller of prepared rice, bread and other foods.</p>
